  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.1.0\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- feat: Implement custom interactive preview host with live element inspection and XAML source mapping (`7e9000e`)\n- style: homogenizar altura a 30px y compactar tipografía en la barra de herramientas (`0f67a87`)\n- refactor: simplificar encuadre inicial usando ZoomBorder.AutoFit en lugar de manipular la ventana (`76d90b9`)\n- feat: autoajustar tamaño de ventana al contenido en carga inicial y compactar barra de herramientas (`c80c6b3`)\n- fix: normalizar URIs de archivo (file://) y corregir recurso de icono Avalonia (`0e16bc2`)\n- feat: Add desktop integration script for Linux and update README (`93e96b3`)\n- feat: Add package icon and Flaticon attribution to README and app (`5a34c21`)\n- ci: Add GitVersion and deployer.yaml for DotnetDeployer.Fleet (`c4c19e3`)\n- feat: Configure as dotnet tool with command name zafiro-avalonia-showme (`d739103`)\n- feat: Pin top-left and lock resize thumbs to cursor with PanDelta compensation (`11dbc85`)\n- feat: Add pointer capture and debouncing to ResizeThumb (`d5fa7da`)\n- Add interactive resize thumbs and dimension presets for custom preview sizes (`f7cbd00`)\n- Support multi-assembly apps in PreviewTargetResolver, auto-fit preview on load (`07eca9b`)\n- feat: initial implementation of Zafiro.Avalonia.ShowMe (`86999eb`)\n",
